## Security and compliance

- [Security and compliance](https://customer.io/security/): Customer.io is SOC 2 Type II certified, HIPAA-eligible (with BAA support), GDPR compliant, and CCPA compliant. Data centers are available in the United States and European Union (Belgium). Customer.io supports SSO, 2FA, role-based permissions, and privacy management controls.
- [Feature Terms for AI](https://customer.io/legal/feature-terms): Customer.io's AI Feature Terms state that third-party AI providers (Gemini, Anthropic) are contractually prohibited from using customer data to train their models. Data is processed solely to deliver the requested AI feature.

